<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="l63jemFF7JkL8xwAk5dJ">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2014" dy="1113" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Hello Interview Delivery Framework&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Requirement Gathering (Functional &amp;amp; Non-functional)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Entity Extraction &amp;amp; API&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Data Flow (if data engineering or intensive question)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. HLD that satisfies basic functional requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Deep dive into non functional requirements&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="129" width="440" x="-57" y="-176" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Requirements" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="-390" y="31" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Functional" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="-401" y="81" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. Given a long URL with an optional alias, the URL shortener generates a short URL&lt;div&gt;2. Upon visiting the short URL in browser, the user is redirected to the original long URL&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="61" width="592" x="-418" y="163" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Non-functional" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="150" x="-428" y="266" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. CAP theorem: Availability &amp;gt;&amp;gt; Consistency. Eventually consistent system is fine" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="508" x="-375" y="318" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="3. Generated short URL should be as short as possible, and also not have any collisions" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="508" x="-355" y="422" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="2. Low latency long to short URL redirection (&amp;lt;200ms, human being perceive this as real time)&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="573" x="-373" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="4. Read &amp;gt;&amp;gt; Writes: Users are more likely to read the shortened to long URL mapping. Thus, making it read heavy system. This fact will have implications for the design downstream (separating out reads and writes, caching, indexing etc)&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="508" x="-344" y="473" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Scale of the system:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="197" x="-442" y="574" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="100M DAU and 1 Billion URLs" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="197" x="-396" y="631" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-15" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Entities and API:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="189" x="-454.5" y="707" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-16" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Entities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Long URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Short URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. User&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="168" x="-454.5" y="737" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="API" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="-126" y="703" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-18" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="POST /shortened-url&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;longUrl&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;alias?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;expirationTime?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Returns shortened URL key&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;GET myurlshortener.com/{key}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Redirect to long URL&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="188" width="185" x="-169" y="763" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-19" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="HLD that satisfies basic functional requirements" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="253" x="-443" y="1039" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-20" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Client" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-289" y="1164" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-22" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Primary Server&lt;div&gt;- creates short URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- looking long URL from short&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-27" y="1161" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-23" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;aspect=fixed;" value="Database" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="80" x="206" y="1151" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-24" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="URL&lt;div&gt;- ShortUrl/CustomAlias&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- LongUrl&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- ExpirationTime?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- CreationTime&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- UserId&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="109" width="192" x="381" y="1143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-25" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="User&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- UserId&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;....(other info like email and metadata)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="109" width="192" x="636" y="1147" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-26" edge="1" parent="1" source="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-22" style="endArrow=classic;startArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-20" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="303" y="1139" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="353" y="1089" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-27" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="getShortUrl(long)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="88" x="-134" y="1149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-28" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="redirect(short)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="88" x="-140" y="1190.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-29" edge="1" parent="1" source="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-22" style="endArrow=classic;startArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-23" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="191" y="1143" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="241" y="1093" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-30" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Non functional requirements (deep dives)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="245" x="-420" y="1395" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-31" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="- 302 Redirect (instead of 301) to make sure there is telemetry on our end for all requests&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;301 is Permanent redirect, it will be cached on client side, CDN etc&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="267.5" x="-410" y="1295" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-32" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. Till now, we had black boxed the part where the short code gets generated.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Let&#39;s discuss different options and discuss their tradeoffs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Non-functional requirement for short URL:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Fast generation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Short in length (5-7 characters)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Unique&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Going one by one through the naive to best options&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Option 1:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Use a distributed sequential counter (with decimal base) and assign the short URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Problem: With scale of 1 Billion URLs, it will have 10 digits but our non-functional requirement is to have in 4-5 digits&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Option 2:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Use a random number generator in the range of 0 to 1 Billion&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Problem: Chances of collision are there&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Option 3:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Use a hashing algorithm like MD5 or SHA on the long URL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;to generate the short URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Problem: Collisions, also the output produced by these hash functions is long&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Option 4:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Use sequential distributed counter but do base62 encoding to reduce the number of digits.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Base62 encoding is obtained by dividing the number repeatedly by 62 and writing the remainder in reverse order (similar to how decimal to binary conversion is done)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Base62 encoded result will have characters from a-z,A-Z,0-9&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;As a capacity estimate, 6 characters of base62 encoded data will produce 62^6= 56 Billion combinations, which is much higher than even our scale of 1 Billion URLs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Few notes about this approach:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. There can be security concern about using a distributed counter with base62 encoding, since the sequence number is predictable now. To reduce this, we can use a bijective (one to one) function which will map the output of distributed counter to a different number. Thus, reducing the predictability of the sequence. Example: sqids.org provides bijective function&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. How should the distributed counter be implemented?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;a. Evan (Hello interview guy) uses Redis based counter with INCR command&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pros: Fast in performance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Cons: Not durable, even though we can introduce read replicas etc but still cache shouldn&#39;t be used as persistent data store&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;b. My design:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Use a database for generating the sequence number&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pro: Durable data store&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Con: Slower than cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Possible workaround to get low latency:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Application servers can pre-generate a set of sequence numbers from DB(let&#39;s say 100) and keep it in-memory&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1077" width="433" x="-428" y="1537" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-34" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="2.Coming to other Non functional requirement, AP System (Eventually consistent)&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This can be satisfied by taking any NoSQL DB like Cassandra, DynamoDB etc&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="143" width="336" x="-467" y="2698" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-35" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="3. Other non-functional requirement to have low latency redirects and being a read heavy system:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Separate out reads and writes, at both service and DB layer which allows to scale independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Use Redis Cache on the read path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Create DB Index on fields which are frequently accessed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="91" width="381" x="-470" y="2885" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-36" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Final design after incorporating the non-functional requirements:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="323" x="-467" y="3064" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-37" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Client" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-453" y="3212" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4sKmwTz25wvMcoeHdur-38" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="API Gateway" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-211" y="3212" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
